&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vinted is Europe&#39;s largest secondhand fashion platform. The Marketplace team owns the core experience: how people discover, list, buy, and sell.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Staff Product Designer to raise the design bar and bring strategic clarity to some of the most complex problems in the product. You&#39;ll join the Marketplace product design leadership team and be part of the craft leadership group, alongside a fellow Staff Product Designer, Staff Design Technologist, and Senior Product Designers from across domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be accountable for projects that land measurable impact. &lt;/strong&gt;You define what the right work is. You don&#39;t wait for it to be scoped for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the capability of ICs in your area.&lt;/strong&gt; You make this happen through pair work, critique, and direct coaching.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help other functions start thinking like designers. &lt;/strong&gt;As a result of your impact, PMs and engineers actively reference design principles in their own decisions. You earn this through osmosis, not training decks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive how design standards evolve.&lt;/strong&gt; You own the bar and raise it as the business, tech, and user context changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make AI-powered ways of working real for the team.&lt;/strong&gt; You experiment, systematise, and communicate. You also reason clearly about what AI changes for users, not just for internal workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn ambiguous signals into investable opportunities. &lt;/strong&gt;You are expected to build the case and move senior stakeholders to commit, not just surface options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Produce work that is above the current team bar.&lt;/strong&gt; Others calibrate to it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Earn the trust of senior leaders. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll do this through sound judgment, clear narratives, and the confidence to help them make big bets on design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proven experience (typically 10+ years) of product design for consumer-scale digital products. Marketplace experience is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio that shows taste, judgment, and shipped impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You move work forward without being asked. You&#39;re as comfortable doing as directing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with AI in your actual workflow: design, prototyping, and automation. You use it, not just discuss it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp eye for quality. You know when the last 1% matters and when it doesn&#39;t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steady when the work gets slow, contested, or unglamorous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity. You know when to go deep and when to ship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong point of view and the ability to adjust it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve changed how an organisation works, not just what it shipped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
