&lt;li&gt;You’ll nurture the engineering talent in your teams, encouraging personal development, managing performance and ensuring everyone is aligned with product delivery objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re unlikely to be particularly hands-on with the code, but will have enough technical experience to be able to contribute to and guide technical discussions, bringing the big picture context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll work closely with our clients, alongside product managers and client success teams, to ensure we are delivering real value within their wider programme.&lt;/li&gt;
