&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement content strategy that serves client&#39;s commercial objectives, including A/B testing plans for Amazon product pages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end content management across all publishing platforms: case raising, set-up, upload, editing, amends, and ongoing maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
